        "date_formatted": "September 28, 2026, 11:17 pm",
        "text": "\ud83c\udf0a\ud83d\udc99 AGHIMUAN presents: the Booth at PCU's 80th Foundation Week! \ud83d\udc99\ud83c\udf0a<br><br><div>Step right up to the Aghimuan tent, where tech meets creativity! \ud83c\udfaa\u2728 We're bringing you handmade products and playable games, all made by our very own members.<br><br><\/div><div>\ud83d\udd11 3D Printed Keychains &amp; Fidgets<\/div><div>Keyboard Keys Keychain: \u20b155 \/ \u20b135 \u2328\ufe0f<\/div><div>Coin Holder Keychain: \u20b170<\/div><div>Cone Fidget: \u20b150<\/div><div>Heart \"Love\" Keychain: \u20b130<\/div><div>Mini Animal Keychain: \u20b125<\/div><div>Flower Keychain: \u20b125\u201330<\/div><div>Name Keychain: \u20b130\u201360 (get yours customized! \ud83d\udc40)<br><br><\/div><div>\ud83c\udfae Play Our Games<\/div><div>AghiEscape!! (2-player co-op): \u20b135 per pair<\/div><div>AghiAim (30-second aim challenge): starting at \u20b110<\/div><div>AghiSudoku: starting at \u20b115<\/div><div>AghiClaw (claw machine): starting at \u20b15<br><br><\/div><div>Whether you're after a keepsake, a gift for someone special, or a chance to flex your reflexes and brainpower, we've got something for you! \ud83c\udfc6<\/div><div>Come by, say hi, and support your ICT community. Every purchase helps our club Connect. Innovate. Explore. \ud83d\udcab<br><br><\/div><div>\ud83d\udccd Aghimuan Booth, PCU-D 80th Foundation Week<\/div><div>\ud83d\udcc5 S.Y. 2026\u20132027<\/div><div>\u2014 AGHIMUAN OFFICERS<\/div><div>Aghimuan S.Y. 2026\u20132027<\/div><div>#Aghimuan #PCUD80 #80thFoundationWeek #ConnectInnovateExplore #PCU #3DPrinting #ICT&nbsp;<\/div>",
