        "date_formatted": "September 28, 2026, 11:14 pm",
        "text": "\ud83c\udf0a\ud83d\udc99 AGHIMUAN | 80th Foundation Week: Day 1 Highlights \ud83d\udc99\ud83c\udf0a<br><br><div>The 80th Foundation Week of Philippine Christian University is officially open! \ud83c\udf89\u2702\ufe0f<br><br><\/div><div>Day 1 kicked off with the ribbon cutting ceremony, which marked the start of a week of celebration across campus. Right after, the Student Organization Booths came alive, and our Aghimuan booth was buzzing with laughter, photo ops, and visitors. \ud83d\udcf8\u2728<br><br><\/div><div>Thank you to everyone who stopped by our photobooth frame to strike a pose, grab some props, and make memories with us!<br><br><\/div><div>To our Aghimuan members who worked hard to set up, man the booth, and welcome everyone with a smile: this is what Connect. Innovate. Explore. looks like in action. \ud83d\udcab<br><br><\/div><div>One day down, more to go! Come visit us again and see what else we have in store. \ud83d\udc2c<br><br><\/div><div>\ud83d\udccd Aghimuan Booth, Student Organization Booths 2026<\/div><div>\ud83d\udcc5 September 28, 2026<\/div><div>\ud83c\udfeb Philippine Christian University \u2013 Dasmari\u00f1as<br><br><\/div><div>\u2014 AGHIMUAN OFFICERS<\/div><div>Aghimuan S.Y. 2026\u20132027<\/div><div>#Aghimuan #PCUD80 #80thFoundationWeek #Day1Highlights #RibbonCutting #ConnectInnovateExplore #StudentOrganizationBooths2026 #PCU<\/div>",
